#. セレスティア・ルーデンベルク…
msgctxt "0001 | CELES"
msgid "Celestia Ludenberg."
msgstr ""

#. セレスティア・ルーデンベルク…
msgctxt "0002 | CELES"
msgid "Celestia...Ludenberg..."
msgstr ""

#. …どうしたの？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What are you doing...?"
msgstr ""

#. うふ、何度聞いても素晴らしい響きですわ。
#. 我ながら惚れ惚れする名前ですわね。
msgctxt "0004 | CELES"
msgid ""
"No matter how many times I hear it, I never tire of\n"
"hearing my own name. Isn't it so splendidly charming?"
msgstr ""

#. 前から気になってたんだけどさ…
#. どうして、その名前なの？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, I've been wondering about that. Why *that*\n"
"name?"
msgstr ""

#. …どうして？
msgctxt "0006 | CELES"
msgid "...Why?"
msgstr ""

#. 何か由来でもあって…
#. その名前を付けたの？
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I mean, is it from something? Why'd you pick it?"
msgstr ""

#. 由来も何も…親から授かった、
#. わたくしの名前ですわ。
msgctxt "0008 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I did not *pick* it. My name was given to me by my\n"
"mother and father..."
msgstr ""

#. 親から授かったって…
#. それって本名じゃないでしょ？
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Come on, that can't be your real name, can it?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>本名<CLT>ですわよ。
#. 決まっているじゃありませんか。
msgctxt "0010 | CELES"
msgid ""
"It is, indeed, my <CLT 3>real name<CLT>. Make no mistake about\n"
"that."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、ご両親がそんな名前を付けたって事？
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay, so your parents gave you that name?"
msgstr ""

#. フランス貴族の父と…
#. ドイツの音楽家である母がね…
msgctxt "0012 | CELES"
msgid ""
"That's right. My father is French nobility, and my\n"
"mother is part of a German family of musicians."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや…明らかにウソだろうけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no way that's true...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …って事は、セレスさんの出身も、
#. フランスかドイツ…
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But okay, so were you born in France or Germany?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>栃木県<CLT>ですわ。
msgctxt "0015 | CELES"
msgid "<CLT 3>Tochigi<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこはいいんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now we're getting somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うふふ、栃木県の中部の出身です。
#. 県庁所在地で、餃子の都市でもあります。
msgctxt "0017 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I was born in the capital of Tochigi, which is known\n"
"for its delicious gyoza."
msgstr ""

#. ご存知ですか？
msgctxt "0018 | CELES"
msgid "Do you know of which city I speak?"
msgstr ""

#. 宇都宮
msgctxt "0019 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Utsunomiya"
msgstr ""

#. 足利
msgctxt "0020 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Ashikaga"
msgstr ""

#. 足利だったかな？
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is it...uh...Ashikaga?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0022 | CELES"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. あれ？
#. もしかして、間違った？
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? Does that mean I'm wrong...?"
msgstr ""

#. …失礼しました。
#. まさか、そのような答えが来るとは思わず。
msgctxt "0024 | CELES"
msgid ""
"You must excuse me. I simply wasn't anticipating an\n"
"answer like that..."
msgstr ""

#. 栃木の県庁所在地もわからないなんて…
#. 小学生以下の知性ですわね。
msgctxt "0025 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Any elementary school child knows what the capital of\n"
"Tochigi is, so naturally..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 日光
msgctxt "0027 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Nikko"
msgstr ""

#. 日光だっけ？
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Nikko, I think...?"
msgstr ""

#. まあっ…
msgctxt "0029 | CELES"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

#. え？　どうかした？
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? Am I right?"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、栃木の観光地と言えば日光です。
msgctxt "0031 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Nikko is certainly one of the most beautiful parts of\n"
"Tochigi, this is true."
msgstr ""

#. ですから苗木君の印象に残っていても
#. おかしくありませんけど…
msgctxt "0032 | CELES"
msgid ""
"So it's no surprise it would leave a lasting\n"
"impression on you."
msgstr ""

#. まさか、先ほどの質問に対して答えるなんて。
#. 呆れて物も言えません…
msgctxt "0033 | CELES"
msgid ""
"But to think you would consider that an appropriate\n"
"answer to my question... Simply appalling."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>充分言ってると思うけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I should stop talking...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あら、おわかりになりませんの？
msgctxt "0035 | CELES"
msgid "Well now, do you really not know the answer?"
msgstr ""

#. 餃子で町おこしをして
#. すっかり有名になりましたのに…
msgctxt "0036 | CELES"
msgid ""
"The sudden popularity of our gyoza revitalized the\n"
"town, and put us on the map again."
msgstr ""

#. うん、そうだよね。
#. ボクも…思い出しかけてるんだけど…
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I think I'm starting to remember. It's right\n"
"there...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう…
#. 栃木県の県庁所在地で餃子の都市って言えば…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So it's the capital of Tochigi, and it's famous for\n"
"its gyoza...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 宇都宮…？
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's Utsunomiya, right...?"
msgstr ""

#. 大正解ですわ。
#. 一応、小学生並の知識はあるようですわね。
msgctxt "0040 | CELES"
msgid ""
"That is correct. You have proven you are roughly as\n"
"intelligent as an elementary school student."
msgstr ""

#. まぁ…高校生だからね…
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Or a high schooler, maybe...?"
msgstr ""

#. 意外かもしれませんが、
#. わたくし、<CLT 3>餃子が大好物<CLT>ですの。
msgctxt "0042 | CELES"
msgid ""
"You may be surprised to learn that I absolutely adore\n"
"<CLT 3>gyoza<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. あの下品で臭い食べ物が大好物ですの。
msgctxt "0043 | CELES"
msgid "I love its stench, its base vulgarity."
msgstr ""

#. ですから、少々残念ですわね。
#. もう２度と、あの町の餃子を口に出来ないのが…
msgctxt "0044 | CELES"
msgid ""
"So as you can imagine, I'm quite disappointed that I\n"
"will never taste my hometown's gyoza again."
msgstr ""

#. もう２度と…なんて事はないよ…
#. ここから出られれば…
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Never say never, you know...? Once we get out of here—"
msgstr ""

#. わたくし達は出られません。
msgctxt "0046 | CELES"
msgid "We will never get out of here."
msgstr ""

#. いつまで未練がましい事を言っているのですか？
#. いい加減、諦めた方がよろしいですわよ。
msgctxt "0047 | CELES"
msgid ""
"How long will you continue with this ridiculousness?\n"
"You should give up."
msgstr ""

#. でないと、人を殺す事になりますわ…
msgctxt "0048 | CELES"
msgid "If you don't, it can only lead to murder..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不気味な言葉を残して、
#. セレスさんはその場から去っていった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Celeste's eerie words stuck with me long after she'd\n"
"left.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんか知れば知るほど…
#. セレスさんの事がわからなくなっていくな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The more I talk to her, the more I just don't\n"
"understand her...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>セレスの<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Celeste's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. スキル<CLT><CLT 3>“レイズ”<CLT><CLT 23>を獲得致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>You just unlocked the skill <CLT><CLT 3>Raise<CLT><CLT 23>!\n"
"Give yourself a pat on the back. You've earned it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>モノクマメダル<CLT><CLT 23>を発見、獲得した際に、今までよりも
#. 多く手に入れることが可能でございます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>When you find <CLT><CLT 3>Monocoins<CLT><CLT 23>, you'll now earn more than\n"
"you did before.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>セレスさんと別れた後、
#. ボクは自分の部屋へと帰った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Once I was all finished, I headed back to my room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
